"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ1011002","city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,30,65,34,68,63],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1012302"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[55,30,65,34,68,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1012302"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ1010002","city":"CS1067","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[55,30,65,34,68,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1012302"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"高句丽山上王高延优之妾，酒桶村女。母亲怀孕时，按照习俗询问巫者，巫者占卜后言‘必生王后’。母亲大喜，生下女儿后取名‘后女’。建安十三年，遇见打猎途中的高延优，受到对方的一见钟情。曾被皇后于氏计划暗杀，但没成功。后来，成为高延优的第二任王后，并为其生下一子(东川王位宫)。","tc":"高句麗山上王高延優之妾，酒桶村女。母親懷孕時，按照習俗詢問巫者，巫者占卜后言‘必生王后’。母親大喜，生下女兒后取名‘后女’。建安十三年，遇見打獵途中的高延優，受到對方的一見鐘情。曾被皇后于氏計劃暗殺，但沒成功。后來，成為高延優的第二任王后，并為其生下一子(東川王位宮)。","en":"Concubine of King Sansang (Gao Yanyou) of Goguryeo, a maiden from Jutong Village. When her mother was pregnant, she consulted a shaman according to custom, who divined, ‘You will surely give birth to a queen.’ Overjoyed, the mother named the newborn girl ‘Hou Nü’ (Daughter of Queen). In the thirteenth year of Jianan, she met Gao Yanyou while he was hunting, and he fell in love with her at first sight. Queen Yu once plotted to assassinate her, but failed. Later, she became Gao Yanyou's second queen and bore him a son (King Dongcheon, Wei Gong).","jp":"高句麗の山上王・高延優の側室。酒桶村の出身。母が懐妊した際、習俗に従って巫者に問うたところ、「必ずや王后を産むであろう」と占われた。母は大いに喜び、産まれた娘を「后女」と名付けた。建安十三年、狩猟の途上にあった高延優に見初められる。かつて王后于氏に暗殺を企てられたが失敗に終わった。のちに高延優の第二王后となり、一子（東川王・位宮）をもうけた。","kr":"고구려 산상왕 고연우의 첩으로, 주통촌 출신의 여인입니다. 어머니가 임신했을 때 풍습에 따라 무당에게 묻자, 무당이 점을 치고는 '반드시 왕후를 낳을 것이다'라고 하였습니다. 어머니는 크게 기뻐하여 딸을 낳은 뒤 이름을 '후녀'라 지었습니다. 건안 13년, 사냥을 나온 고연우와 마주쳤는데, 고연우가 첫눈에 반하였습니다. 한때 왕후 우씨가 암살을 꾀했으나 실패하였습니다. 이후 고연우의 두 번째 왕후가 되었으며, 아들 하나(동천왕 위궁)를 낳았습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"62","id":"WJ1054515","remark":"","surname":"山上","surnameTc":"山上","surnameEn":"Sansang","surnameJp":"山上","surnameKr":"산상","surnameOther":"","name":"小后","nameTc":"小后","nameEn":"Xiao Hou","nameJp":"小后","nameKr":"소후","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"山上小后","power":"WJ1010002","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1067","gender":"1","rule":"55","force":"30","wise":"65","politics":"34","charm":"68","will":"63","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"5","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"14/14/17/14/17/65/18/14","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1003705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5900","battleSoulPoint":"800","debateSoulPoint":"5100","strategy":"","strategy2":"1000805","professions":"3/0/0/2/0/0/2/2/1/2/2/2/1/3/0/1/1/1/1/0/1/2/2/1","attribute2":"79/85/68/34/78/72","morality":"5","compatible":"55","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"175","show":"188","death":"227","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"6","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1013605","helmet":"WP1012302","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character